Q: How can I find the earliest unrepeated character in Python more efficiently? A: <p>Another approach that relies on the fact that (since Python 3.7) insertion order is preserved when adding keys to a dictionary, you could do this:</p>
<pre><code>def first_unique_char(string: str) -&gt; str | None:
    if string:
        d = {}
        for c in string:
            if c in d:
                del d[c]
            else:
                d[c] = None
        if d:
            return next(iter(d.keys()))
</code></pre>

Q: SELECT parent-child records from JOINed tables then present as grouped unordered lists with CodeIgniter A: <p>Controller methods should never directly interact with the database, that is the responsibility of the model.</p>
<p>Pass the sheet id to a single model method which returns qualifying sheets and their child (clip) rows.</p>
<p>Using a LEFT JOIN is appropriate if a sheet might have no related clips. If all sheets will always have a clip, then JOIN should be used.</p>
<p>Including sheet ids and clip ids in the results will afford the possibility of creating links to other pages in your HTML.</p>
<p>Controller:</p>
<pre><code>public function sheetClips()
{
    $this-&gt;load-&gt;model('Sheet_model', 'SheetModel');
    $data['groupedSheetClips'] = $this-&gt;SheetModel-&gt;getSheetsWithClips(
        $this-&gt;uri-&gt;segment(3)
    );
    $this-&gt;load-&gt;view('show_sheets_and_clips', $data);
}
</code></pre>
<p>Model:</p>
<pre class="lang-php prettyprint-override"><code>public function getSheetsWithClips(int $id): array
{
    $rows = $this-&gt;db
        -&gt;select('s.id sheet_id, s.sheet_name, c.*')
        -&gt;join('clips c', 'c.sheet_id = s.id', 'left')
        -&gt;get_where('cue_sheets s', ['s.id' =&gt; $id])
        -&gt;result_array();

    $grouped = [];
    foreach ($rows as $row) {
        $groupId = $row['sheet_id'];
        $grouped[$groupId]['sheet_name'] ??= $row['sheet_name'];

        if ($row['clip_name'] === null) {
            $grouped[$groupId]['clips'] = [];
        } else {
            unset($row['sheet_id'], $row['sheet_name']);
            $grouped[$groupId]['clips'][] = $row;
        }
    }
    return $grouped;
}
</code></pre>
<p>View:</p>
<pre class="lang-php-template prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;?php 
foreach ($groupedSheetClips as $sheetId =&gt; ['sheet_name' =&gt; $sheetName, 'clips' =&gt; $clips) { ?&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;&lt;?php echo $sheetName; ?&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;?php if (!$clips) { ?&gt;
        No Clips Found
    &lt;?php } else { ?&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;?php foreach ($clips as $clip) { ?&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;&lt;?php echo $clip['clip_name']; ?&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;?php } ?&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;?php } ?&gt;
&lt;?php } ?&gt;
</code></pre>
